# Maintainer test harnesses for the gates. The gates themselves ship — they are what the
# plugin does — but their harnesses are only meaningful in this repository, where run-all.mjs
# can find them.
hooks/test-*.mjs
hooks/run-all.mjs

# The judgment fixture is a whole sample app used to grade doc-this's output. Packed, it
# becomes judge input for the skill it exists to test.
skills/doc-this/evals/

# Maintainer test harnesses for the skills' own scripts — same reasoning as the gate harnesses
# above: only meaningful in this repository.
skills/*/scripts/test-*.mjs

# The viewer's Svelte + Vite source. Consumers run the compiled bundle in assets/viewer/; the
# source is committed for maintenance, which is the development-only material .tesslignore's
# own documented example excludes. Nothing links into it, so validation stays green.
skills/doc-this-viewer/app/

# Eval scenarios at the plugin root, for the same reason as the judgment fixture above: packed,
# they become input to the judge that reviews this plugin.
/evals/
